<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady</p>
<p>with Tuesday's full strength. Trading active. Top $61.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   61.00-61.50</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   60.50-61.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   59.50-60.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   58.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   57.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 1.00 lower; heavier weights steady. Top</p>
<p>56.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs   51.00,</p>
<p>some lean 400-450 lbs   52.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs   53.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs   54.00-56.00</p>
</text>
